    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "petrolatum? i dont have any of that here. but i do have some coconut oil and some aloe vera gel. if i just put the aloe on it, is that safe enough? i really dont want to go to the hospital, it's so expensive and it's just a little burn, surely i can just treat it myself with the aloe and be fine?",
